Spec: Countdown cue

Purpose:
  Which countdown seconds are announced by voice.

Owns:
  ./countdown_cue.dart
  /test/domain/countdown_cue_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/21-countdown-cue.md

Must:
  Seconds `5` down to `1` are announced.
  Zero and everything above `5` get no cue; the start cue comes from the ride start.

Example:
  `@countdownCueFor(5)`: `5`
  `@countdownCueFor(6)`: `null`
  `@countdownCueFor(0)`: `null`
